# 31. Immediate Next Step

The next step is:

## Phase 0 / Phase 1 — Hardware Inventory

Before wiring anything:

1. identify every sensor and module available;
2. identify the exact model/reference where possible;
3. decide which components belong to V1;
4. document their voltage and pin requirements;
5. define the exact wiring plan;
6. verify power requirements;
7. only then begin the first motor-control circuit.

No hardware should be connected until the motor voltage, sensor voltages, Raspberry Pi voltage levels, and L298N wiring have been verified.
